import ../../ui/native.dl
import pictures_interface.dl

set instance to an instance of picture workspace
set view to a desktop view of (the address of instance) sized 800 by 600 using fonts "assets/fonts/NotoSans-Regular.ttf" and "assets/fonts/NotoSans-SemiBold.ttf"
run the address of view
close the address of view
set other to a desktop view of (the address of instance) sized 800 by 600 using fonts "assets/fonts/NotoSans-Regular.ttf" and "assets/fonts/NotoSans-SemiBold.ttf"
ignore update UI view the address of other
require condition ((UI image from "tests/assets/pictures/colors.svg" in (the address of other))'s status = 1) reporting "Reopening a picture view lost its native codecs"
close the address of other
close the address of instance
